Fibonacci Number:
How to calculate Fibonacci numbers:
always first 2 numbers are given 0,1
now the formula is to find next Fibonacci  number is to add previous two numbers(see intro Fibonacci  number.png)

fib Number=[0,1,1,2,3,5,8,13.....]
   indexes  0 1 2 3 4 5 6 7....
   
There are two approaches to solve Fibonacci approach (See image of Approaches)
1)Iterative approach   2)Recursive Approach

1)Iterative approach 
Iterative Approach example which i solve:
let arr=[0,1],n=8
for (let i=0;i<n;i++){
  let val=arr[i]+arr[i+1]
  arr.push(val)
}
console.log(arr[n])

